{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "name": "M Blade",
  "theme": "mblade",
  "_about": "M Blade, after a photo of a BMW M cluster view (Nov 14 2026), generated by tools/gen_mblade_navi.py (edit that and regenerate): a blue card with the M stripes and a dark plate for the gear and the speed, a red rev blade leaning right (0..7000 rpm, the stock-style shift light at the top), and two thin gauge pairs to its right: the hybrid battery (in place of the photo's oil temperature) and the fuel with the range. The battery charge runs along the bottom, clear of BMW's belt light (x 587..626, y 663..700); the oil and outside temperatures are on the right. Waze's map is drawn at the centred 1088x480 of the panel, so with 'Show Waze map inside the theme' (or Cluster Centre / Cluster Info) the theme is rebuilt (backdrop_open and the o_ readouts): a small card on the left with the gear and speed, the see-through window at x 600..1054, y 168..502 over the map's middle, and the blade and gauges moved 148 px right. The blade and the gauges keep clear of the black box BMW draws at x 1406..1597, y 342..419. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
